WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Every creator's store starts empty.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.400
You have the audience. But what do you sell?

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.100
What do you charge? And what do you write?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.700
Meet Minute Store.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.700
Tell us what you do, in one line.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.700
We suggest what to sell, price it for Indian buyers, and write your page.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.000
In English, Hinglish, or Hindi.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.700
Edit anything. Then share one link.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.800
Minute Store. Your store, ready in a minute.
